<title>USA: LaTex extends deadline for merger.</title>
<headline>LaTex extends deadline for merger.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaTex Resources Inc said Thursday it has agreed to extend the deadline for completion of its Alliance Resources Plc merger one month until March 31.</p>
<p>Other terms of the transaction remain the same.</p>
<p>&quot;We have responded to the SEC comments to our F-4 filing and are awaiting any remaining mionr modifications. Once the regulatory review is complete, we will be able to seek shareholder approval,&quot; said LaTex chief executive Jeff Wilson.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
